-   entry .Issue   what the parser found wrong: the reason inside a `Parse.Error` from HTML
+   entry .Issue
+     info
+         ce que l'analyseur a trouvé d'incorrect : la raison contenue dans une `Parse.Error` issue
+         du HTML

-     detail
-         An enum of `zephyrine.Format.Issue`s, each with a `describe` message, carried in the
-         `Parse.Error(Html, position, issue)` a strict read raises, with an `Html.Position`.
-         The cases: `BadInsertion` (_a value cannot be inserted into HTML at this point_, an
-         `h"…"` substitution in a position no value fits); `ExpectedMore` (_the content ended
-         prematurely_); `UnexpectedDoctype`; `BadDocument` (_the document did not contain a
-         single root tag_, from `load[Html]`); `InvalidCdata` (_CDATA content is only
-         permitted in foreign namespaces_); `InvalidTag(name)` (_`<name>` is not a valid tag_);
-         `InvalidTagStart(prefix)`; `DuplicateAttribute(name)`; `InadmissibleTag(name,
-         parent)` (_`<name>` cannot be a child of `<parent>`_); `OnlyWhitespace(char)` (a
-         character where a whitespace-mode element admits only whitespace); `Unexpected(char)`;
-         `UnknownEntity(name)` (_the entity `&name` is not defined_); `ForbiddenUnquoted(char)`
-         (a character forbidden in an unquoted attribute value); `MismatchedTag(open, close)`;
-         `UnopenedTag(close)`; `Incomplete(tag)` (_the content ended while the tag `<tag>` was
-         left open_); `UnknownAttribute(name)`; `UnknownAttributeStart(name)`; and
-         `InvalidAttributeUse(attribute, element)` (_the attribute `name` cannot be used on the
-         tag `<tag>`_).
+     detail
+         Une énumération de `zephyrine.Format.Issue`, chacune avec un message `describe`, portée
+         dans la `Parse.Error(Html, position, issue)` que lève une lecture stricte, avec une
+         `Html.Position`. Les cas : `BadInsertion` (_a value cannot be inserted into HTML at this
+         point_, une substitution `h"…"` à une position où aucune valeur ne convient) ;
+         `ExpectedMore` (_the content ended prematurely_) ; `UnexpectedDoctype` ; `BadDocument`
+         (_the document did not contain a single root tag_, issu de `load[Html]`) ; `InvalidCdata`
+         (_CDATA content is only permitted in foreign namespaces_) ; `InvalidTag(name)` (_`<name>`
+         is not a valid tag_) ; `InvalidTagStart(prefix)` ; `DuplicateAttribute(name)` ;
+         `InadmissibleTag(name, parent)` (_`<name>` cannot be a child of `<parent>`_) ;
+         `OnlyWhitespace(char)` (un caractère là où un élément en mode espaces n'admet que des
+         espaces) ; `Unexpected(char)` ; `UnknownEntity(name)` (_the entity `&name` is not
+         defined_) ; `ForbiddenUnquoted(char)` (un caractère interdit dans une valeur d'attribut
+         sans guillemets) ; `MismatchedTag(open, close)` ; `UnopenedTag(close)` ; `Incomplete(tag)`
+         (_the content ended while the tag `<tag>` was left open_) ; `UnknownAttribute(name)` ;
+         `UnknownAttributeStart(name)` ; et `InvalidAttributeUse(attribute, element)` (_the
+         attribute `name` cannot be used on the tag `<tag>`_).

