+         `poster`, `data`, `itemid`, …

-       `Attributive.url` accepts any value which is `Abstractable across Urls to Text` — an
-       `HttpUrl`, or any typed URL — and a `Text` once `attributives.textAttributive` is in
-       scope.
+     detail
+         `Attributive.url` accepte toute valeur qui est `Abstractable across Urls to Text` — une
+         `HttpUrl`, ou toute URL typée — et un `Text` dès que `attributives.textAttributive` est
+         dans la portée.

